            "review_text": "Adriana Q\n13 contributions\n0\nBest food I had in my trip\nApr 2026 • Friends\nIf you’re in Ho Chi Minh City, don’t miss this place. The food is incredible and easily the highlight of the experience.\n\nThe soup is hands down the best I’ve ever had. Rich, comforting, and packed with flavor in every bite. You can tell it’s made with care and experience.\n\nThe women who run it are very kind and welcoming, which makes the experience even better.\n\nSimple, authentic, and unforgettable. I will definitely be coming back.\nRead more\nWritten April 9, 2026\nTrung N\nCám ơn du khách có trải nghiệm tốt ở quán , còn giới thiệu cho bạn bè nữa ! Quán chúng tôi chân thành cám ơn và biết ơn du khách\nWritten May 2, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
